-------------------------------------------------------------------
Sun Nov 22 09:39:34 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to version 3.3.0:
  * Add dbi-affected-rows API with affected_rows support in
    MySQL, PostgreSQL and SQLite3 back ends, with tests.
  * PostgreSQL back end: add pgvector read support and fix
    NaN/Infinity float handling in query results.
  * Fix MySQL getrow handling of SQL NULL.
  * Make dbi-open and dbi-close thread-safe.
  * Add dbi-conn-reset to reset connection handles.
  * Fix makeinfo documentation build.
  * Drop old unused ChangeLogs in subdirectories.
- Drop guile-dbi-doc-subdirs.patch: merged upstream (PR #35).

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Tue Nov 10 18:17:59 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- New package (version 3.2.0), DBI database abstraction for GNU
  Guile, needed by GNU Artanis.
- Upstream is the maintained opencog/guile-dbi tree (signed 3.2.0
  tag); builds the database-independent core with its test DBD
  back end.
- Add guile-dbi-doc-subdirs.patch: fix TAB-indented conditional
  doc SUBDIRS append that make misparsed as a recipe, so the user
  manual is built and shipped.
- Add guile-dbi-rpmlintrc: filter devel-file-in-non-devel-package
  for libguile-dbd-test.so, a DBD plugin dlopened by its
  unversioned name at runtime that must ship in main.

